{"seq":1,"slug":"debit-credit-balanced-entry","title":"借贷分录与平衡校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/double-entry-posting/debit-credit-balanced-entry","wordCount":2091,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"借贷分录与平衡校验\">借贷分录与平衡校验</h1><p>账本的数据模型只有两张核心表：分录头（journal entry）与分录行（journal line）。所有记账语义都压在这两张表上，所以它们的设计一次要定对——尤其是&quot;平衡校验在哪一层执行&quot;这个问题，它决定了系统能不能防止不平衡的数据进入账本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分录头与分录行\">核心概念：分录头与分录行</h2><p>一笔业务动作产生<strong>一条分录头</strong>和<strong>两条或更多分录行</strong>。头承载&quot;这次记账是什么&quot;，行承载&quot;钱从哪到哪&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>所在表</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>为什么必须存在</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>entry_id</code></td>\n<td>头</td>\n<td>全账本唯一的分录标识</td>\n<td>红冲与溯源的外键锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>biz_ref</code></td>\n<td>头</td>\n<td>业务单号（订单号/退款号）</td>\n<td>从业务反查分录的唯一入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>entry_type</code></td>\n<td>头</td>\n<td>业务类型（PAYMENT/REFUND/FEE/SETTLE）</td>\n<td>分类查询与规则路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>posted_at</code></td>\n<td>头</td>\n<td>过账时间（账务日期）</td>\n<td>期间归属、关账判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>currency</code></td>\n<td>头</td>\n<td>分录币种（多币种时可为空）</td>\n<td>单币种分录的快速校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>account_id</code></td>\n<td>行</td>\n<td>记在哪个账户</td>\n<td>余额聚合的维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>direction</code></td>\n<td>行</td>\n<td><code>DR</code> / <code>CR</code></td>\n<td>平衡校验的符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>orig_amount</code></td>\n<td>行</td>\n<td>原币金额（最小单位整数）</td>\n<td>余额与流水的权威值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>func_amount</code></td>\n<td>行</td>\n<td>本位币金额</td>\n<td>跨币种汇总与报表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>有一个设计取舍值得展开：<strong>币种放在头还是行</strong>。放在头上，一笔分录只能有一个币种，平衡校验就是&quot;同币种内借贷相等&quot;，简单且快。放在行上，一笔分录可以跨币种（比如用美元户支付欧元账单），表达力更强，但平衡校验必须按币种分组，且&quot;这笔分录平不平&quot;不再是一个标量判断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两张表的-ddl-与关键约束\">两张表的 DDL 与关键约束</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE journal_entry (&#10;  entry_id     VARCHAR(40)  PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  biz_ref      VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,&#10;  entry_type   VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,&#10;  posted_at    TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL,&#10;  period_key   INT          NOT NULL,   -- 形如 202609，关账与分区键&#10;  currency     CHAR(3),                -- NULL 表示跨币种分录&#10;  reversal_of  VARCHAR(40)  REFERENCES journal_entry(entry_id),&#10;  hash_chain   BYTEA,                  -- 见第四章审计留存&#10;  created_at   TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE journal_line (&#10;  line_id      BIGSERIAL    PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  entry_id     VARCHAR(40)  NOT NULL REFERENCES journal_entry(entry_id),&#10;  line_no      SMALLINT     NOT NULL,&#10;  account_id   VARCHAR(40)  NOT NULL REFERENCES account(account_id),&#10;  direction    CHAR(2)      NOT NULL CHECK (direction IN (&#39;DR&#39;,&#39;CR&#39;)),&#10;  orig_amount  BIGINT       NOT NULL CHECK (orig_amount &gt; 0),&#10;  func_amount  BIGINT       NOT NULL CHECK (func_amount &gt;= 0),&#10;  currency     CHAR(3)      NOT NULL,&#10;  UNIQUE (entry_id, line_no)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_line_entry   ON journal_line(entry_id);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_line_account ON journal_line(account_id, entry_id);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_entry_bizref ON journal_entry(biz_ref, entry_type);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> journal_entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  biz_ref      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  posted_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_key   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 形如 202609，关账与分区键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NULL 表示跨币种分录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reversal_of  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry(entry_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hash_chain   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BYTEA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 见第四章审计留存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> journal_line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry(entry_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  line_no      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account(account_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  direction    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  orig_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (orig_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  func_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (func_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry_id, line_no)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_line_entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line(entry_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_line_account</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line(account_id, entry_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_entry_bizref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry(biz_ref, entry_type);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个约束值得特别注意。<code>orig_amount &gt; 0</code> 保证金额永远是正数，方向单独用一个字段表达——允许负数金额会让&quot;借 -100&quot;和&quot;贷 100&quot;两种等价写法并存，报表聚合时必然出错。<code>func_amount &gt;= 0</code> 用了大于等于，是因为外币折算可能因四舍五入得到 0，但绝不能为负。<code>UNIQUE (entry_id, line_no)</code> 保证行序稳定，红冲时按行对应生成反向分录需要这个顺序。</p>\n<p><code>biz_ref</code> 上的索引是溯源查询的基础，但<strong>它不是唯一索引</strong>——同一业务单号可能产生多条分录（支付一条、手续费一条、退款一条），所以是&quot;业务单号 → 多条分录&quot;的一对多映射。这个映射的方向性在溯源篇会详细展开，见 <a href=\"../ledger-query-period-close/ledger-trace-flow-query\">账目溯源与账户流水</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平衡校验-判定与实现\">平衡校验：判定与实现</h2><h3 id=\"平衡的定义与按币种分组\">平衡的定义与按币种分组</h3><p>平衡的定义：对一笔分录，按币种分组后，每组内借方原币金额之和等于贷方原币金额之和。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>currencies</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>E</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>E</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall c \\in \\text{currencies}(E): \\sum_{l \\in E, l.c = c,\\ l.dir = DR} l.orig = \\sum_{l \\in E, l.c = c,\\ l.dir = CR} l.orig</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">currencies</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>单币种分录退化成一个标量等式，跨币种分录则要求每个币种各自平——不能把美元和欧元加起来判断平衡，那是没有意义的两数相加。</p>\n<h3 id=\"校验放哪一层\">校验放哪一层</h3><p>校验实现在哪一层，是三选一的工程决定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现层</th>\n<th>能否防住绕过</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>可读性</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用层（记账服务内）</td>\n<td>否（绕过服务直连库即失效）</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>必须做，但不充分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库触发器/约束</td>\n<td>是（任何写入路径都受约束）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>强一致要求高时做</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步校验作业</td>\n<td>否（脏数据已入库）</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>只能作为兜底检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>结论是两层都要做</strong>：应用层做前置校验给出清晰的业务错误，数据库层做最终约束防止绕过。只做应用层的系统，在有人跑数据修复脚本、做数据迁移、或直连数据库补数据时，不平衡数据就会进去，而且要等到关账时才发现，那时已经跨了几个期间，修复代价极高。</p>\n<p>数据库层的平衡校验有两种实现方式。用触发器直观但性能有损耗（每行插入都触发）；更常用的做法是<strong>先写头与行，再用一条语句校验并在校验失败时回滚整个事务</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"BEGIN;&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO journal_entry (entry_id, biz_ref, entry_type, posted_at, period_key, currency)&#10;VALUES (&#39;E20260927042&#39;, &#39;ORDER-99120&#39;, &#39;PAYMENT&#39;, &#39;2026-09-27T10:00:00Z&#39;, 202609, &#39;CNY&#39;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO journal_line (entry_id, line_no, account_id, direction, orig_amount, func_amount, currency) VALUES&#10;  (&#39;E20260927042&#39;, 1, &#39;ACC_BANK_MAIN&#39;,            &#39;DR&#39;, 10000, 10000, &#39;CNY&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;E20260927042&#39;, 2, &#39;ACC_PAYABLE_MERCHANT_M77&#39;, &#39;CR&#39;,  9900,  9900, &#39;CNY&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;E20260927042&#39;, 3, &#39;ACC_FEE_REVENUE&#39;,          &#39;CR&#39;,   100,   100, &#39;CNY&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 同一事务内校验：任何币种借贷不等则抛错，整个事务回滚&#10;DO $$&#10;DECLARE bad_currency CHAR(3);&#10;BEGIN&#10;  SELECT currency INTO bad_currency&#10;    FROM (&#10;      SELECT currency,&#10;             SUM(CASE WHEN direction = &#39;DR&#39; THEN orig_amount ELSE -orig_amount END) AS net&#10;        FROM journal_line&#10;       WHERE entry_id = &#39;E20260927042&#39;&#10;       GROUP BY currency&#10;    ) t&#10;   WHERE net &lt;&gt; 0&#10;   LIMIT 1;&#10;&#10;  IF FOUND THEN&#10;    RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;unbalanced entry % currency %&#39;, &#39;E20260927042&#39;, bad_currency;&#10;  END IF;&#10;END $$;&#10;&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry (entry_id, biz_ref, entry_type, posted_at, period_key, currency)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20260927042'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ORDER-99120'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAYMENT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-09-27T10:00:00Z'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">202609</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line (entry_id, line_no, account_id, direction, orig_amount, func_amount, currency) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20260927042'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACC_BANK_MAIN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20260927042'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACC_PAYABLE_MERCHANT_M77'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20260927042'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACC_FEE_REVENUE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同一事务内校验：任何币种借贷不等则抛错，整个事务回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DO $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECLARE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bad_currency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bad_currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">             SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orig_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">orig_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_line</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'E20260927042'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FOUND </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RAISE EXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unbalanced entry % currency %'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E20260927042'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, bad_currency;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把校验放在<strong>事务内、提交前</strong>，是这段代码的关键。放在事务外（先提交再校验）等于把脏数据永久化；放在事务内则&quot;不平衡则整笔不存在&quot;，这才是原子性该有的语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"借贷方向与金额符号的约定\">借贷方向与金额符号的约定</h2><h3 id=\"三条约定\">三条约定</h3><p>方向与符号必须全系统统一，否则一定会出现&quot;退款记成负数借方&quot;这类混乱。约定三条：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>金额永远正数</strong>，方向由 <code>direction</code> 表达。</li>\n<li><strong>方向由记账服务推导</strong>，业务方只表达账户金额的增减（见 <a href=\"../account-chart-model/internal-account-chart\">内部账户与科目体系</a> 中关于 <code>normal_side</code> 的讨论）。</li>\n<li><strong>分录内借贷两个方向都必须出现</strong>。一笔只有借方、没有贷方的分录在结构上就不成立——即使金额为零也不行，零金额分录应当直接拒绝。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第三条有一个边界情形：<strong>分拆后某个方向金额为零</strong>。比如一笔交易手续费恰好等于全额，商户部分为 0，此时是否保留一行金额为 0 的应付商户款行？实践上应当拒绝零金额行，因为它不携带任何信息，且会干扰&quot;分录行数&quot;类的统计。让业务层在构造分录时过滤掉零金额行，并断言剩余行数 ≥ 2 且两个方向都存在。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[业务请求&lt;br/&gt;biz_ref + 金额] --&gt; B[构造分录行&lt;br/&gt;账户 + 增减表达]&#10;  B --&gt; C{存在零金额行?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[过滤掉]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[推导 direction&lt;br/&gt;按 normal_side]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{借贷两向&lt;br/&gt;都存在?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[拒绝: 结构不成立]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H{按币种分组&lt;br/&gt;借贷相等?}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[拒绝: 不平衡]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[写头 + 行&lt;br/&gt;同事务]&#10;  J --&gt; K[事务内二次校验]&#10;  K --&gt;|失败| L[回滚]&#10;  K --&gt;|成功| M[更新余额 / 生成快照增量]\">flowchart TD\n  A[业务请求&lt;br/&gt;biz_ref + 金额] --&gt; B[构造分录行&lt;br/&gt;账户 + 增减表达]\n  B --&gt; C{存在零金额行?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[过滤掉]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[推导 direction&lt;br/&gt;按 normal_side]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{借贷两向&lt;br/&gt;都存在?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[拒绝: 结构不成立]\n  F --&gt;|是| H{按币种分组&lt;br/&gt;借贷相等?}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[拒绝: 不平衡]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[写头 + 行&lt;br/&gt;同事务]\n  J --&gt; K[事务内二次校验]\n  K --&gt;|失败| L[回滚]\n  K --&gt;|成功| M[更新余额 / 生成快照增量]</pre><p>这张图也是&quot;记账服务的健康路径&quot;：任何一个判断失败点都应当返回明确的业务错误码，而不是让数据库约束抛异常给上层——后者会让业务方拿到无法处理的底层错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分录的粒度-一笔业务一条分录还是多条\">分录的粒度：一笔业务一条分录还是多条</h2><h3 id=\"判定标准-是否存在部分可独立撤销\">判定标准：是否存在部分可独立撤销</h3><p>同一个业务事件应该产生一条分录还是多条？这直接影响红冲与溯源的复杂度。</p>\n<p><strong>一条分录、多个行</strong>（推荐）适用于所有资金在同一时刻完成转移的场景：支付拆成&quot;银行收入 + 应付商户 + 手续费收入&quot;三行，是一条分录。它的好处是红冲时一笔反向分录就能完整撤销，溯源时一次查询返回全貌。</p>\n<p><strong>多条分录</strong>适用于时间上分离的阶段：支付时一条（钱进在途户），清算时一条（在途户到银行户），结算时一条（银行户到商户）。它们不是同一时刻发生的事件，强行合成一条会让&quot;部分红冲&quot;变得无法表达——清算完成了但支付要冲销，这个动作在合并模型下没有对应语义。</p>\n<p>判定标准可以总结成一句话：<strong>只要存在&quot;其中一部分可以先独立撤销&quot;的可能，就必须拆成多条分录</strong>。反之则合并，因为合并能减少分录数量（对几十亿行的表，数量本身就是成本）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用-biz_ref-串联多条分录\">用 biz_ref 串联多条分录</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 时间分离的阶段拆成多条分录，用 biz_ref + entry_type 串联&#10;SELECT entry_id, entry_type, posted_at, currency&#10;  FROM journal_entry&#10; WHERE biz_ref = &#39;ORDER-99120&#39;&#10; ORDER BY posted_at, entry_id;&#10;-- 结果形如：&#10;-- E20260927042 | PAYMENT  | 2026-09-27T10:00:00Z&#10;-- E20260928011 | CLEARING | 2026-09-28T02:00:00Z&#10;-- E20260930077 | SETTLE   | 2026-09-30T02:00:00Z\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 时间分离的阶段拆成多条分录，用 biz_ref + entry_type 串联</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_id, entry_type, posted_at, currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> journal_entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> biz_ref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ORDER-99120'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posted_at, entry_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 结果形如：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- E20260927042 | PAYMENT  | 2026-09-27T10:00:00Z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- E20260928011 | CLEARING | 2026-09-28T02:00:00Z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- E20260930077 | SETTLE   | 2026-09-30T02:00:00Z</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询就是溯源的最小形式。它之所以能工作，是因为 <code>biz_ref</code> 在三个阶段保持同一个值——这是分录模型必须提供的东西，不能等到溯源需求出现再补，因为那时的历史数据已经缺字段了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分录头与分录行是账本的原子结构，平衡校验是它的守卫。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>头管&quot;是什么&quot;，行管&quot;从哪到哪&quot;</strong>，币种在单币种场景放头、跨币种场景放行，平衡校验按币种分组。</li>\n<li><strong><code>orig_amount &gt; 0</code> + 独立 <code>direction</code> 字段</strong>是方向表达的唯一正确形式，禁止负数金额与零金额行。</li>\n<li><strong>平衡校验应用层与数据库层都要做</strong>，前者给业务友好错误，后者防绕过；校验必须在过账事务内、提交前完成。</li>\n<li><strong>方向由记账服务按 <code>normal_side</code> 推导</strong>，不让业务方直接传 <code>DR</code>/<code>CR</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>是否存在&quot;部分可独立撤销&quot;决定分录粒度</strong>，能部分撤销就必须拆成多条分录。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分录一旦写入就不能再改——写错了怎么办，见 <a href=\"immutable-posting-reversal\">不可变过账与红冲</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"借贷分录与平衡校验","id":"借贷分录与平衡校验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分录头与分录行","id":"核心概念-分录头与分录行"},{"level":3,"text":"两张表的 DDL 与关键约束","id":"两张表的-ddl-与关键约束"},{"level":2,"text":"平衡校验：判定与实现","id":"平衡校验-判定与实现"},{"level":3,"text":"平衡的定义与按币种分组","id":"平衡的定义与按币种分组"},{"level":3,"text":"校验放哪一层","id":"校验放哪一层"},{"level":2,"text":"借贷方向与金额符号的约定","id":"借贷方向与金额符号的约定"},{"level":3,"text":"三条约定","id":"三条约定"},{"level":2,"text":"分录的粒度：一笔业务一条分录还是多条","id":"分录的粒度-一笔业务一条分录还是多条"},{"level":3,"text":"判定标准：是否存在部分可独立撤销","id":"判定标准-是否存在部分可独立撤销"},{"level":3,"text":"用 biz_ref 串联多条分录","id":"用-biz_ref-串联多条分录"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"账户层级与归属","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/account-chart-model/account-hierarchy-ownership"},"next":{"title":"不可变过账与红冲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/double-entry-ledger-platform/double-entry-posting/immutable-posting-reversal"}}